*.rbxl
*.rbxlx

# Asset extraction scratch — only reviewed, public-safe outputs are committed.
# Path B (template-extracted) binaries must NEVER be committed: in a public repo that is
# standalone redistribution, a Unity EULA breach. They live under extraction/ (ignored).
extraction/*
!extraction/README.md
!extraction/asset-inventory.csv
!extraction/kaykit-diff.md
!extraction/gamedata-json/
!extraction/originals/
!extraction/*.py

